        'A project begins with a mandate: the assignment and the authority to start. It comes from the sponsor: the manager who holds the budget and takes the big decisions.\n\nWithout mandate and sponsor you do not have a route but a hobby. Check two things on every project: who gave this mandate, and would they still say so today?',
        'Each stage has its own module in this app: Intake, Plan, Run, Land and Close. This lesson is the overview; the modules give the depth. The first weeks of a project are covered by the lesson The first weeks in Intake, so nothing of that is repeated here.\n\nRemember the question per stage, the stage product and who sits at the decision.',
