        'The principle is proportionality: the route grows with size and risk. Look at four things: duration, money, the number of parties involved and what happens if it goes wrong.\n\nA two-week fix gets one page. A six-month programme with suppliers, a working group and a board gets every stage product and a decision point between the stages.',
